    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20988" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hortensĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a garden</i>, <i>garden-.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bulbi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					20, 9, 40, § 105</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">batis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					26, 8, 50, § 82</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
