				n., <i>garden-herbs</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 19, 6,
				31, § 98</span></i>; <i><span class="en">19, 8, 39, §
			131</span></i>; <i><span class="en">26, 4, 10,
				§ 22</span></i>.</div>
